  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Cook the lasagna sheets in salted water until al dente, then drain and set aside.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a skillet over medium heat and add the minced garlic, cooking until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the crushed tomatoes, cumin, coriander, paprika, harissa paste, dashi extract, salt, pepper, and water, then simmer for 15 minutes.",
    "Remove the sauce from heat and fold in the mozzarella, kefalotyri, and chopped parsley.",
    "Grease a 9x13 inch baking dish with a little oil.",
    "Layer the cooked lasagna sheets and the cheese sauce, starting and ending with a layer of sauce.",
    "Bake uncovered for 25 minutes, then let the lasagna rest for 5 minutes before serving."
  ],
